<p>On June 1, 2026 — Children's Day in China — Connie engaged 7 AI AGENTS (Globalization Researcher, Human-AI Fit Researcher, Knowledge Coach, Product Manager, Education Designer, Self-Directed Learning Strategist, and Human-AI Synergy Architect) in a deep interdisciplinary conversation across three topics:</p>

